### Sector-Wide Impact

The rally was not confined to technology stocks. Renewable energy companies saw some of the biggest gains:

1. **Solar** companies surged an average of **12%**
2. **Wind** energy firms rose **9.5%**
3. **Battery** manufacturers climbed **11.2%**
4. Traditional **fossil fuel** stocks dipped **2.3%**

&gt; **Analyst Note:** *"Investors are signaling that sustainability is no longer a niche concern — it's the mainstream. Companies that ignore this shift do so at their own peril."* — Marcus Chen, Chief Strategist at Horizon Capital

